@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title S01-ddd-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: RoleController" as ctl
participant "svc: RoleApplicationService" as svc
participant "auth: AuthorizationApplicationService" as auth
participant "repo: AuthorizationRepository" as repo
participant "graph: RoleHierarchy" as graph
participant "audit: AuditApplicationService" as audit
participant "integrity: GrantIntegrityService" as integrity
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. link(bearer, seniorId, juniorId)
activate ctl
ctl -> svc: 2. link(principal, senior, junior, true)
activate svc
group local write transaction: lock before grant reads
svc -> repo: 3. lockGrants()
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> auth: 4. require(principal, rbac:role:edit, true)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> repo: 5. role(senior)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> repo: 6. role(junior)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> auth: 7. requireRoleManagement(actor, role)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 8. requireRoleManagement(actor, other)
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over auth
Role.requireManageable checks SUPER_ADMIN capability.
Cross-system rejected before graph mutation.
end note
svc -> repo: 9. hierarchy(role.systemCode())
activate repo
deactivate repo
alt self / cycle / duplicate
svc -> graph: 10. link(senior, junior)
activate graph
graph --> obj: DomainException; abort / rollback
deactivate graph
else valid edge
svc -> graph: 11. link(senior, junior)
activate graph
deactivate graph
svc -> svc: 12. requireAffectedGrants(actor, graph, changedRole, permissions)
activate svc
svc -> graph: 13. affectedBy(changedRole.id())
activate graph
deactivate graph
loop changed role and every affected senior
svc -> auth: 14. requireGraphGrant(actor, graph, affectedId)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 15. upperBound(actor, systemCode, proposedClosure)
activate auth
deactivate auth
end
note over auth
All checks precede saveRole/saveEdges; actor facts still precede mutation.
Special-capability traversal includes disabled nodes.
end note
deactivate svc
note over auth
requireGrantable traverses even disabled nodes:
no pre-planted path to SUPER_ADMIN; permission-set inclusion alone is insufficient.
end note
svc -> repo: 16. saveEdges(systemCode, graph.edges())
activate repo
deactivate repo
end
svc -> integrity: 17. requireAdministrator()
activate integrity
deactivate integrity
svc -> repo: 18. advanceVersion()
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> audit: 19. local(actor, system, type, target, SUCCESS, null)
activate audit
deactivate audit
end
note over svc
Transaction proxy commits only normal return.
Any exception aborts: no edge/version/SUCCESS fact persists.
end note
deactivate svc
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml